    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#999999\">眺望高岭，人影淹没雪原，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">步行山麓，痛觉鲜活似真。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">我不为所动，又无声呼喊，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">Heal the World，在眼中浮现。</span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"0d8201456dae60375da42ade6a9a73ee\" title=\"图片.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20211224/0d8201456dae60375da42ade6a9a73ee.png\"/></div><p></p>",
